{"seq":1,"slug":"multi-task-learning","title":"推荐系统多任务学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommendation-algorithms/advanced/multi-task-learning","wordCount":1361,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"推荐系统多任务学习\">推荐系统多任务学习</h1><p>工业推荐系统从来不只优化一个指标——短视频平台同时关心点击率、完播率、点赞率、评论率；电商平台同时优化 CTR、加购率、CVR、客单价。多任务学习（Multi-Task Learning, MTL）让单一模型同时预估多个业务目标，共享表示学习的收益，同时避免为每个目标独立训练模型带来的维护成本和特征不一致问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>多任务推荐的核心挑战是<strong>任务间的关系管理</strong>——相关任务互相促进（正迁移），冲突任务互相拖累（负迁移/跷跷板现象）。架构设计的本质是找到&quot;共享什么、不共享什么&quot;的最优平衡点。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[输入特征] --&gt; B[共享表示层]&#10;    B --&gt; C[任务 A Tower: CTR]&#10;    B --&gt; D[任务 B Tower: CVR]&#10;    B --&gt; E[任务 C Tower: 完播率]&#10;    C --&gt; F[融合排序分]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F\">graph TD\n    A[输入特征] --&gt; B[共享表示层]\n    B --&gt; C[任务 A Tower: CTR]\n    B --&gt; D[任务 B Tower: CVR]\n    B --&gt; E[任务 C Tower: 完播率]\n    C --&gt; F[融合排序分]\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>共享机制</th>\n<th>任务冲突处理</th>\n<th>代表公司</th>\n<th>年份</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Shared-Bottom</td>\n<td>完全共享底层</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>早期通用</td>\n<td>2017-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MMoE</td>\n<td>多专家软门控</td>\n<td>门控自动分配</td>\n<td>Google</td>\n<td>2018</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PLE</td>\n<td>显式分离共享/专属专家</td>\n<td>渐进式抽取</td>\n<td>腾讯</td>\n<td>2020</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AITM</td>\n<td>注意力信息迁移</td>\n<td>序列任务依赖建模</td>\n<td>阿里</td>\n<td>2021</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DTN</td>\n<td>任务特定特征交互</td>\n<td>分离特征交互</td>\n<td>Shopee</td>\n<td>2024</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SMES</td>\n<td>稀疏 MoE 路由</td>\n<td>渐进式专家路由</td>\n<td>快手</td>\n<td>2026</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"mmoe-多门控混合专家\">MMoE：多门控混合专家</h2><p>MMoE（Multi-gate Mixture-of-Experts）是多任务推荐的里程碑方案。它将 Shared-Bottom 中单一的共享层替换为多个专家网络，每个任务有自己的门控网络决定如何组合这些专家的输出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f^k(x) = \\sum_{i=1}^n g_i^k(x) \\cdot f_i(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1491em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个专家网络，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>g</mi><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0435em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是任务 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 的门控网络：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>g</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>softmax</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g^k(x) = \\text{softmax}(W_g^k x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1491em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2822em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">softmax</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>MMoE 的核心优势是：不同任务可以通过门控机制&quot;选择性地&quot;使用不同专家的输出，隐式实现了任务间的差异化共享。但其所有专家仍是全局共享的——当任务严重冲突时，冲突梯度同时作用于所有专家，导致跷跷板现象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ple-显式专家分离与渐进式抽取\">PLE：显式专家分离与渐进式抽取</h2><p>PLE（Progressive Layered Extraction）直接解决了 MMoE 的跷跷板问题。核心改进是<strong>显式区分共享专家与任务专属专家</strong>：</p>\n<p>每一层 Extraction Network 包含：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>共享专家</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msubsup><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msubsup><mi>E</mi><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{E_1^{shared}, \\ldots, E_m^{shared}\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4519em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，所有任务共同使用</li>\n<li><strong>任务 k 专属专家</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msubsup><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msubsup><mi>E</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{E_1^k, \\ldots, E_p^k\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2322em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4519em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，仅任务 k 使用</li>\n</ul>\n<p>任务 k 的门控输入是其<strong>自身专属专家 + 共享专家</strong>的输出，不直接使用其他任务的专属专家：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mtext>Gate</mtext><mi>k</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msup><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo><msup><mi>E</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">o^k = \\text{Gate}^k([E^{shared}; E^k])</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1723em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Gate</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9223em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">([</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">])</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>&quot;渐进式&quot;体现在多层堆叠——更高层的输入来自下一层所有专家的输出，实现了逐层深度信息抽取。</p>\n<p><strong>在线效果</strong>（腾讯视频）：相比 MMoE，PLE 在视频完播率上提升 2.2%，同时评论率提升 4.1%，证明了显式分离策略有效缓解了跷跷板现象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2025-2026-新进展\">2025-2026 新进展</h2><h3 id=\"dtn-任务特定特征交互\">DTN：任务特定特征交互</h3><p>Shopee 提出的 DTN（KDD 2026）发现：多任务模型中同一个特征对不同任务的重要性可能完全不同（特征重要性分歧现象）。DTN 为每个任务设计独立的特征交互模块，而非在共享表示上做后期分离：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>线上效果：点击量 +3.28%，订单量 +3.10%，GMV +2.70%</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"smes-稀疏-moe-扩展\">SMES：稀疏 MoE 扩展</h3><p>快手 SMES（2026）将稀疏 MoE 引入多任务推荐，实现模型参数的大规模扩容同时控制推理成本：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>渐进式专家路由</strong>：先选共享专家子集，再选任务自适应私有专家</li>\n<li><strong>去重专家执行</strong>：避免同一专家被多任务重复计算</li>\n<li><strong>全局负载均衡</strong>：多门控联合正则化稳定训练</li>\n</ul>\n<p>线上 A/B 测试显示：在保持推理 FLOPs 不变的前提下，通过专家稀疏化将模型从 16 专家扩展到 128 专家，所有任务指标均有提升。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ektm-跨任务知识迁移\">EKTM：跨任务知识迁移</h3><p>华为 EKTM（2026）引入 Router-Transmitter 架构，让稀疏的 CVR 任务直接从丰富的 CTR 任务中迁移知识：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>Transmitter</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Router</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_{CVR} = h_{CVR} + \\text{Transmitter}(\\text{Router}([h_{CTR}; h_{like}; h_{follow}]))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Transmitter</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Router</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">([</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ik</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>线上 eCPM 提升 3.93%，已部署在两个主流量场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多目标融合排序\">多目标融合排序</h2><p>多任务模型输出多个预估分数后，需要融合成最终排序分。常见策略：</p>\n<p><strong>加权求和</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score} = \\sum_k w_k \\cdot \\hat{y}_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，权重人工设定或自动调优</p>\n<p><strong>期望收益公式</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>×</mo><mtext>price</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score} = pCTR \\times (w_1 + w_2 \\cdot pCVR \\times \\text{price} + w_3 \\cdot pDuration)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">pC</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">pC</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">price</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>帕累托最优</strong>：将多目标优化建模为帕累托前沿搜索，选择不被任何其他配置支配的方案</p>\n<p><strong>动态权重</strong>：根据当前时段/用户群组动态调整各目标权重（如流量高峰期降低探索权重）</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>多任务学习是工业推荐的标配范式，核心是管理任务间的正/负迁移</li>\n<li>MMoE 开创了门控专家路由，PLE 通过显式分离解决了跷跷板问题</li>\n<li>2026 年趋势是稀疏 MoE 大规模扩容、任务特定特征交互、跨任务知识迁移</li>\n<li>多目标融合排序是将模型输出转化为最终业务价值的关键环节</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../systems/recall-ranking-pipeline\">召回-排序多阶段流水线</a>——多任务模型在精排阶段的定位</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../ab-testing-statistics/statistical-methods/hypothesis-testing\">A/B 测试与假设检验</a>——多目标优化效果的在线统计验证方法</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"推荐系统多任务学习","id":"推荐系统多任务学习"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"MMoE：多门控混合专家","id":"mmoe-多门控混合专家"},{"level":2,"text":"PLE：显式专家分离与渐进式抽取","id":"ple-显式专家分离与渐进式抽取"},{"level":2,"text":"2025-2026 新进展","id":"2025-2026-新进展"},{"level":3,"text":"DTN：任务特定特征交互","id":"dtn-任务特定特征交互"},{"level":3,"text":"SMES：稀疏 MoE 扩展","id":"smes-稀疏-moe-扩展"},{"level":3,"text":"EKTM：跨任务知识迁移","id":"ektm-跨任务知识迁移"},{"level":2,"text":"多目标融合排序","id":"多目标融合排序"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"推荐系统在线服务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommendation-algorithms/systems/online-serving"},"next":{"title":"LLM 驱动的推荐系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommendation-algorithms/advanced/llm-based-recommendation"}}